name: Crimson Heart — sell to un-debuff
author: corpus
description: >-
  Crimson Heart debuffs all cards until 1 Joker is sold. Ante 8 finisher: keep a cheap
  sellable joker or disable with Luchador/Chicot.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - boss: CrimsonHeart
    antes: [8]
should:
  - joker: Luchador
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Chicot
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: RiffRaff
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
